sV1.How We Use Personal Information:
p10
I1
sVWe may also share information with partners who distribute and assist us in advertising our services.
p11
I1
sVWhenever you voluntarily disclose personal information on publicly-viewable pages, that information will be publicly available and can be collected and used by others.
p12
I1
sVAs an integral part of providing the WooPlus service, we will disclose your profile information to your matches.
p13
I1
sVWhile you may voluntarily provide us with sensitive information about yourself such as your ethnicity, personal interests, religion or other sensitive information there is no requirement to do so.
p14
I1
sVYour information will not be transferred until you actually accept the offer.
p15
I1
sVThrough the use of a cookie, we also may automatically collect information about your activity on our Service, such as the pages you visit, the time and date of your visits and the links you click.
p16
I1
sVTo implement these features we collect your location data, including but not limited to GPS data, WiFi data, and cell tower data.
p17
I1
sVWe may use your email address and your other personal information to help us efficiently operate the Services, to contact you in connection with your membership and other activities on the Site (including, but not limited to, confirmation emails or important news that could affect your relationship with our site), and to forward messages to you from other WooPlus users.
p18
I1
sV4.Special Cases in which we Share Personal and Financial Information:
p19
I1
sVInformation may be disclosed to authorities that we, in our sole discretion, deem appropriate to handle such disclosure.
p20
I1
sVWe never share your contact information with your matches.
p21
I1
sV, or the feedback options located in the WooPlus Dating app, we collect your email address and the content of the email/feedback that you send to us to help resolve your query.
p22
I1
sVWe may also share demographic information with advertisers on an anonymous and aggregated basis (i.e., without telling the advertisers your identity).
p23
I1
sVIn addition, we may also use the information you provided during registration, to automatically set up an email account for you at the registered Service, so that you can make online dating and social networking more convenient and secure.
p24
I1
sVWe may use public information to enable other users to determine whether they are a match for you and to communicate with you.
p25
I1
sVTo operate the Services, we may share your personal information with our agents, representatives, contractors and service providers so they can provide us with support services such as authorization of credit card transactions, email origination, receipt or support services, and customer relationship management services.
p26
I1
sVWith respect to California's "Shine the Light" law, Civil Code section 1798.83, we do not disclose personal information to third parties for the third parties' direct marketing purposes.
p27
I1
sVFor example, if you post your email address, you may receive unsolicited messages.
p28
I1
sVWe require these entities not to use your information for any other purpose.
p29
I1
sVNeither Apple nor Google provide us with any personal information from your Apple iTunes or Google Play account.
p30
I1
sVYou acknowledge and agree that we may disclose information you provide if required to do so by law, at the request of a third party, or if we, in our sole discretion, believe that disclosure is reasonable to comply with the law, requests or orders from law enforcement, or any legal process (whether or not such disclosure is required by applicable law); protect or defend WooPlus's, or a third party's, rights or property; or protect someone's health or safety, such as when harm or violence against any person (including you) is threatened.
p31
I1
sVIf you choose to accept any such offers, you may either (depending on the situation) directly provide your information in connection with the offer to such third-party provider, or we will provide your information, including billing information, to the third party provider by pre-populating the offer registration forms.
p32
I2
sVPlease read the information below under the heading "Special Cases in which we Share Personal and Financial Information" to learn more ways where we may share your personal information.
p33
I2
sVApple will provide us with a unique transaction ID, the subscription status, the payment status, and reason for subscription cancellation (if applicable).
p34
I1
sVWhen you use the WooPlus Dating app, we automatically collect and store certain information about your mobile device, location, and your activities within the app.
p35
I1
sVWe may use demographic information to tailor the Service and cater to your interests.
p36
I1
sVIf you consent, the pictures or videos you choose will be shared with users of WooPlus App, and may be shared on WooPlus official site, WooPlus social accounts, App Store page, and Google Play page.
p37
I1
sVWe use your financial information to, if applicable, check your qualifications and to bill you our service.
p38
I1
sVWith Whom We Share Your Information
p39
I1
sVAs you use the WooPlus Dating app we also collect data with regards to your actions within the app.
p40
I1
sVWhen you respond to an advertisement, however, we ask you to remember that if that ad that is targeted to a demographic group and you decide to give the advertiser your personal information, then the advertiser may be able to identify you as being a member of that demographic group.
p41
I1
sVIf we advertise, we (or third parties) may use certain data collected on our Service to show you advertisements on other sites or applications.
p42
I1
sVIf you have an outstanding balance, or if you dispute you payment to us with your credit card or financial institution for any reason, please note that all information collected from your activity on our website may be disclosed to the bank and/or collections agency we work with for the purposes of establishing proof of user's identify, proof of use, proof that service was provided, and / or collecting any outstanding debt owed to us.
